  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promotion of social stabilization through improving access of internally displaced persons and their host communities to income-generating activities in Yemen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project aims to support the vulnerable people (i.e. the displaced people (e.g. IDPs), their host communities and others), in particular, who are affected by COVID-19, through providing quick-impact technical and soft skills training, according to their and labor market needs so that they could start or join in income generating activities</narrative>
  </description>
